SELFTEST(1)

NAME
    selftest - run shipped userland self-tests

SYNOPSIS
    selftest

DESCRIPTION
    Shell built-in that runs the installed userland self-test programs,
    including BusyBox, /proc, /dev, TinyCC, filesystem, process, job-control,
    and runtime compatibility probes.

SEE ALSO
    compatprobe(1), jobctlprobe(1), busybox(1), tcc(1)
